abstract: >-
  A complete and falsifiable metrological framework for certifying that a closed
  volume has been transferred between two stations without alteration of its
  contents, without reading those contents and without cloning them. The
  framework is articulated in 109 statements across eight axes of completeness:
  the seven statement axes stand at 100 per cent and the eighth, MEASURED,
  stands at 0 per cent, placing the framework at 87.5 per cent. This is a
  pre-registered protocol for third parties to refute, not a report of results.
